            chapterNumber: 16,
            title: {"en":"Unit 6 Prose: On the Rule of the Road (A.G. Gardiner)","ta":"அலகு 6 உரைநடை: சாலையின் விதி (ஏ.ஜி. கார்டினர்)","hi":"Unit 6 Prose: On the Rule of the Road"},
            summary: {"en":"An illuminating essay on civil liberties, social contract, and respecting the freedom of others.","ta":"தனிமனித சுதந்திரம் என்பது பிறரின் சுதந்திரத்திற்கு இடையூறு இல்லாமல் இருக்க வேண்டும் என்பதை விளக்கும் கட்டுரை.","hi":"An essay on civil liberties, social order, and respecting others' freedom."},
            lessonLines: [
              "Unit 6 Prose: On the Rule of the Road (A.G. Gardiner) — Tamil Nadu State Board Samacheer Kalvi English curriculum.",
              "Gardiner recounts a Petrograd woman walking down the middle of the street claiming personal liberty.",
              "He argues that absolute personal freedom leads to universal anarchy and chaos on the roads.",
              "True civilization is measured by courteous consideration for the rights and comfort of others."
            ],
            lessonLang: "en",
